o the public after sunset on agency premises, the organizer must satisfy all of the following conditions:\"],\"scope_text\":\"For a temporary display open to the public after sunset on agency premises, when an agency employee is assigned to supervise the display for that entire period\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":519,\"summary\":\"For a temporary display open to the public after sunset on agency premises, the duty to appoint an adult steward does not apply when an agency employee is assigned to supervise the display for that entire period.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
